CREATIVE COMMONS ATTRIBUTION 4.0 — bundled 3D model
================================================================================

public/3d/devices/applewatch-clean.glb is a modified copy of "Apple watch
series 5" by atomle, distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence (CC-BY-4.0). CC-BY requires that the credit, the licence
and a statement of changes travel with any redistribution, so this notice has
to remain with the file.

    Title:   Apple watch series 5
    Author:  atomle — https://sketchfab.com/atomle
    Source:  https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/apple-watch-series-5-16950208bdf041f193c31d3b4a0ac15a
    Licence: CC-BY-4.0 — http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

    Changes: rotated 35 degrees about X so the watch face looks down +Z, which
    is the orientation every other bundled device mesh is authored in; the
    display mesh, its node and its material renamed to "Screen", which is how
    three3d/mockup.ts finds the panel to composite onto; and that mesh's
    unused atlas UVs dropped so ensureScreenUVs() builds the planar unwrap the
    screen texture needs. No geometry was added or removed.


